### Homeowners Voting Platform — end-to-end walkthrough
### Run the API first: dotnet run --project src/HoaVoting.Api
@host = http://localhost:5095

### 1. Admin login (seeded from Admin:Email / Admin:Password)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@hoa.local", "password": "change-me" }

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 2. Admin creates an association + its owner (calls Vocdoni: create org)
# @name createAssoc
POST {{host}}/api/associations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "name": "Maple Street Homeowners Voting Platform", "ownerEmail": "owner@maple.local", "ownerPassword": "owner-pw" }

@assocId = {{createAssoc.response.body.id}}

### 3. Owner logs in
# @name ownerLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@maple.local", "password": "owner-pw" }

@ownerToken = {{ownerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. Owner adds a homeowner (Vocdoni: add org member)
POST {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/homeowners
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "name": "Alice", "surname": "Doe", "email": "alice@maple.local", "memberNumber": "A-101", "weight": "1" }

### 5. Owner lists homeowners
GET {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/homeowners
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 6. Owner creates a proposal (Vocdoni: census -> publish -> process -> publish)
# @name createProposal
POST {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/proposals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "title": "Repaint the lobby?",
  "description": "Vote on repainting the shared lobby.",
  "choices": [ { "title": "Yes" }, { "title": "No" } ],
  "startDate": "2026-06-24T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-07-01T00:00:00Z",
  "votingType": "single"
}

@proposalId = {{createProposal.response.body.id}}

### 7. Read results (homeowners cast votes client-side via the Vocdoni JS SDK)
GET {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/proposals/{{proposalId}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 8. Close voting
POST {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/proposals/{{proposalId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
